  "description": "Embed the API Test Spark React SPA into any .NET 10 Minimal API project with a\n      single MapApiTestSpark() call. Autodiscovers OpenAPI v3 endpoints and renders an interactive\n      test UI at /api-test-spark/. Includes sortable response tables, editable object forms, curl\n      command generation, a draggable debug panel, and Azure Application Insights integration. Zero\n      configuration required — just add MapApiTestSpark() to your startup.",
